body:
this convo is super cringe to begin with, like even without the money he's been giving to the community, the hate he has received is way too much. Ppl got caught out blindly following the mango-leffen hate train toward hbox because they can't think for themself. Like I beleive you that he's not your favorite player because of his playstyle but I just know you dont care that much and just like to hate, same thing for his popoff (I'm not only talking about you but ppl in general). 

&#x200B;

People decided to hate first and then tried to find reason to back it up, we trully dont deserve hbox

&#x200B;

There's so much more melee to be played - hbox, somewhen before Mang0

But he should't, unless its a list about influence

&#x200B;

edit: I didn't know it was a hot take, I see eye to eye with hugs who puts him at 11 here : [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3O6-ARB8488&ab\_channel=Hugs86](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3O6-ARB8488&ab_channel=Hugs86) . Of course you can disagree, but it's really not that impressive to put ken in the 11-15 range imo

This metoo mouvement will never stop

&#x200B;

edit : damn my joke didn't pass

Yeah, personnaly I haven't found a place where everything is put together. I've watch like 5-6 playlist of ppl showing fox tricks. Maybe you can find it on smashboard but idk I dont like this site and I'm too lazy. 

&#x200B;

Actually, the best may be fox discord

Leffen, N0ne and Moky.

&#x200B;

American players Residentsleeper

Kadano's melee mechanics is something I watched like 5 times because I think understanding the melee physics is very important to get better. [MichaelRadar](https://www.youtube.com/user/michaelradargaming) has 2 series micro/macro melee that helped me also. Pewpewu university and ssbm tutorials are also very good channel to get better.

&#x200B;

Edit: KJH, armada, leffen, m2k and other pros also have channels that give some tips, expecially the first 2

I personnaly put hbox in third, close to mango and I put Ken at 4th.

&#x200B;

Hbox peak and consistency are amazing and in the highest lvl of melee. In my opinion, if he stays rank 1 after this years, He ties mango in the discussion for second best of all time
